<title>JAPAN: Daiwa Kosho Lease - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daiwa Kosho Lease - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 54.40		vs	   58.18</p>
<p> Operating	    4.12		vs	    5.97</p>
<p> Current		4.41		vs	    6.15</p>
<p> Net		    2.50		vs	    3.37</p>
<p> EPS		   16.71 yen	  vs	   22.48 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    150 million	  vs	 150 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    5.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daiwa Kosho Lease Co Ltd leases prefabricated housing and office units.</p>
